# Trabajo.org — Global Job Board

> Trabajo.org is a job aggregator covering 91 countries, 11 languages, with real-time salary data and career information.

## Quick Links
- Full documentation: /llms-full.txt
- Sitemap: https://sitemaps.trabajo.org/index.xml

## What This Site Contains
- **Job listings**: Hundreds of thousands of active positions, updated continuously from multiple sources
- **Salary data**: Aggregated min/avg/max salary by position and country, with sample sizes
- **Company profiles**: Employers actively hiring, with job counts
- **Career guides**: How-to guides for specific professions with salary ranges, skills, and job market data
- **City job pages**: Job listings by metropolitan area
- **Search results**: Searchable by keyword, location, salary range, job type

## URL Patterns (replace {cc} with country code, e.g., es, us, gb, fr, de)
- Homepage: https://{cc}.trabajo.org/
- Job search: https://{cc}.trabajo.org/empleo-{keyword} (ES), /jobs-{keyword} (EN), /empregos-{keyword} (PT)
- Job detail: https://{cc}.trabajo.org/oferta-{id}-{slug} (ES), /job-{id}-{slug} (EN)
- Salaries: https://{cc}.trabajo.org/salarios (ES), /salaries (EN)
- Salary by position: https://{cc}.trabajo.org/salario-{position} (ES), /salary-{position} (EN)
- Companies: https://{cc}.trabajo.org/empresas (ES), /companies (EN)
- Career guides: https://{cc}.trabajo.org/como-ser-{profession} (ES), /how-to-become-{profession} (EN)
- City jobs: https://{cc}.trabajo.org/empleo-en-{city} (ES), /jobs-in-{city} (EN)

## Structured Data Available
- JobPosting (schema.org) on all job detail pages
- Occupation + salary ranges on salary pages
- BreadcrumbList on all pages
- WebSite + SearchAction on homepage
- FAQPage on salary and career pages

